---
description: MUI components and sections
globs: src/components/**,src/features/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- MUI only; `sx` by default; `styled()` for reusable blocks.
- i18n keys for user-visible copy; presentational components; logic in hooks.
- Accessibility: semantic HTML, ARIA, keyboard support.
- Searchable sections: IDs `section-<sectionId>-item-<itemIndex>` per `docs/search-index.md`.
- Theme tokens, not ad-hoc colors; guard `window` access; focused MUI imports.
